[[1,6411004,0,3,0,3,"2016-09-26T00:04:48","ltmyndonos","",[],"<p>Being from Philly originally and rooting for them all through Rich &quot;Run the ball again&quot; Kotite's era, this is nice. </p>"],[1,6411358,0,3,0,3,"2016-09-26T00:57:49","NotWearingPants","",[],"<p>They seem to have found themselves a franchise quarterback.</p>"],[1,6413397,0,2,0,2,"2016-09-26T07:23:37","philomath","",[],"<p>I'm a bradford fan and was disappointed with the way it worked out for him. Can't fault the eagles, though....this guy looks like he could be something special.</p>"],[1,6413998,0,1,0,1,"2016-09-26T11:13:46","fricknmaniac","",[],"<p>Eagles look really good this year.</p>\n<p>I'll reserve judgment about Wentz until I see how he does next year... because the Eagles have proved they're amazing at finding a spectacular QB for single seasons at a time, but not since McNabb have they had one consistent over multiple seasons.</p>"]]
