s Debates</p>"],[1,6411725,0,2,0,2,"2016-09-26T01:46:01","drakesdoom","",[],"<p>How can you spot the mark on the rest of it?</p>"],[2,6411805,6411725,1,0,1,"2016-09-26T01:58:51","VoutGuy","",[],"<p>As a racist, I don't know how to respond: either the mark or Obama is darker. I can't decide.</p>"],[1,6411817,0,2,0,2,"2016-09-26T02:01:08","FuckNiggerJews","",[],"<p>More like obama is a dark mark on American history.</p>"],[1,6412138,0,1,0,1,"2016-09-26T02:51:24","Deplorable_Me","",[],"<p>heh, a dark mark.</p>"],[1,6412154,0,3,0,3,"2016-09-26T02:53:52","con77","",[],"<p>I was a child in Detroit in '68. Maobama has purposefully provoked racial strife during his treasonous poseurship</p>"],[1,6412405,0,1,0,1,"2016-09-26T03:37:34","fecaliphate","",[],"<p>These riots are nothing but damn powder kegs! All it takes is a terrorist gunman to shoot the blacks or the cops and a huge battle would occur!</p>"]]
