[[0,1308485,0,2,0,2,"2016-09-26T00:00:38","latexdreams","",[],"","The Salton sea opening - quick history of Meth","https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=lSEqkDo2GIk","videos"],[1,6410985,0,1,0,1,"2016-09-26T00:01:54","latexdreams","",[],"<p>First submission, I had it with reddit and found this place. Hopefully the mods here are not stuck up cunts like that fascist fucktard site has. </p>"],[2,6418486,6410985,1,0,1,"2016-09-26T22:02:33","Voopin__Voopin","[e]",[],"<p>Welcome to voat!</p>\n<p>There's no censorship here, except for that one guy <a href=\"https://voat.co/user/Henrycorp\">@Henrycorp</a>. He has gotten ahold of a couple of the major subs, so there are alternatives. see <a href=\"https://voat.co/v/gunsarecool\">/v/gunsarecool</a> versus <a href=\"https://voat.co/v/gunsreallyarecool\">/v/gunsreallyarecool</a> for example. Every sub has mod logs on the sidebar. For shits and giggles, check the &quot;deleted&quot; shit in the modlogs for those subs. This place at least has transparency. and there is no shadowbanning that im aware of.</p>\n<p>Aside from his subs, there is very little censorship here. We dont do the whole &quot;thread full of [deleted]&quot; over here.</p>\n<p>Another nifty little thing, is you can block subs when you browse <a href=\"https://voat.co/v/all\">/v/all</a> and they wont show up anymore. Very useful for filtering out his subs, as well as those you just dont feel like seeing.</p>"]]
