[[0,1308489,0,4,0,4,"2016-09-26T00:03:58","i-am-me","[A]",[],"<p>Yep. Me... Um...</p>\n<ol>\n<li>I regret not being more proactive about hanging with friends. I can still give them a phone call though! It's worth a shot.</li>\n<li>I regret not being healthy throughout adolescence. At least this regret is cleared! I do feel sad that I missed out on a lot then, though. I don't think I'll have the chance to make up for it at this point. But I can still have fun going forward.</li>\n<li>Slacking off with work. Stop slacking off today! (HA)</li>\n</ol>","What regrets do you have today, and how can you reconcile them?","","SelfHelpForABetterMe"],[1,6411152,0,1,0,1,"2016-09-26T00:26:27","FuckNiggerJews","",[],"<p><em>Takes drink</em> No.</p>"]]
[[0,1308490,0,7,1,6,"2016-09-26T00:04:07","DamoclesofBenghazi","",[],"","What Black Lives Matter looks like in a country that banned Soros and the Muslim Brotherhood","https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uO0XRUy3vQ8","OccidentalEnclave"],[1,6411080,0,11,0,11,"2016-09-26T00:17:16","CANCEL-CAT-FACTS","",[],"<p>&quot;Now you will claim racism like usual&quot; but this time we have it on tape. </p>\n<p>And look at how patient they were with his aggression, until he went too far. Russians are the scariest white people.</p>"],[1,6411146,0,9,0,9,"2016-09-26T00:25:20","FuckNiggerJews","",[],"<p>Anyone have a mirror for those without cucktube accounts?</p>"],[2,6412661,6411146,6,0,6,"2016-09-26T04:20:37","antiliberalsociety","",[],"<p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/v/uO0XRUy3vQ8\">https://www.youtube.com/v/uO0XRUy3vQ8</a></p>\n<p>There ya go</p>"],[3,6412728,6412661,3,0,3,"2016-09-26T04:32:42","FuckNiggerJews","",[],"<p>Yeah buddy!</p>"],[3,6413475,6412661,3,0,3,"2016-09-26T07:50:07","GoodGodKirk","",[],"<p>Now I wish I looked in comments first for your post. Wouldn't have to leave the site...</p>"],[1,6411398,0,5,0,5,"2016-09-26T01:04:34","Thirdcopy","",[],"<p>I'm proud to be Russian.</p>"],[1,6411437,0,5,1,4,"2016-09-26T01:09:11","NorwegianBlackMetal","",[],"<p>Lol funny. I've never seen someone casually kick another guys ass.</p>"],[2,6412005,6411437,1,0,1,"2016-09-26T02:29:15","con77","",[],"<p>dont worry. your fukn muslims will be kicking yours soon</p>"],[1,6411500,0,6,0,6,"2016-09-26T01:18:11","con77","",[],"<p>Now if the races were reversed ALL the blacks would have stomped BOTH white guys to death!</p>"],[1,6411567,0,5,0,5,"2016-09-26T01:26:16","CivetGenet","",[],"<p>Should I be moving to Russia?</p>"],[2,6412319,6411567,3,0,3,"2016-09-26T03:23:20","SomewhatNeutral","",[],"<p>Depends on whether you like freedom.</p>"],[1,6412141,0,5,2,3,"2016-09-26T02:51:59","Joe_McCarthy","[e]",[],"<p>The problem I have with these 'based Russia' themed threads is that in their own way the Russians are as hostile to the West as Soros and the Muslim Brotherhood. And more dangerous in a certain sense given their nuclear arsenal.</p>\n<p>Sure, they're white - though even that has some caveats given their more than insignificant mongoloid admixture and Eurasianist self-perception - but only the superficial will leave it at that. Russia fundamentally is part of the Orient, not the Occident, and has a long history of anti-Western politics going back at least 200 years.</p>\n<p>I mean, I can appreciate they don't like gays and such. But then much the same can be said for, say, African countries. And though Robert Mugabe attacks the small number of whites in Zimbabwe unlike Russia he doesn't threaten European countries with nuclear attack.</p>\n<p>So there is the proper perspective here and the improper, Putin ass-kissing perspective. Choose wisely.</p>"],[2,6414549,6412141,3,0,3,"2016-09-26T13:17:44","antiliberalsociety","",[],"<p>In their defense, all the Russians that come here assimilate instead of trying to conquer. They say the smart ones leave, the dumb ones stay behind rooting for Putin. </p>"],[3,6414615,6414549,2,1,1,"2016-09-26T13:30:11","Joe_McCarthy","",[],"<p>A lot of the people we get from Russia are not actually Russians but Russian Jews. They don't tend to be Putin fans and in fact due to their experiences with Russians they tend to be huge liberals. The worst in fact among Jews.</p>\n<p>So it's hard to even look fondly on the place even from an immigration perspective.</p>"],[4,6414814,6414615,2,0,2,"2016-09-26T14:05:03","antiliberalsociety","",[],"<p>The ones I know are conservative yet non religious </p>"]]
